    <guid isPermaLink="false">68c63b7fa56ca3e0c44950c3</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 14 Sep 2025 03:58:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一年一度的苹果发布会又来了！ 让我们失望了几年后，只能说今年Cook的牙膏挤的还不错。从新的airpods 到全系列120HZ屏幕再到Apple Air。虽然离开巅峰期还有距离，但是创新和给到用户需求的产品，永远是驱动电子产品进步的第一动力。&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>我又和好朋友Vincent来聊了聊今年的发布会，我们对于新产品的想法， 希望大家喜欢😊以及告诉我们你们会买哪一个新产品呢？</span><br><span></span><br><span>AirPods Pro 3:</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FokwpPPnG5S_FYqljzxaiwGYmXVJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Apple Watch 新表盘：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhdOACv0UFCPGymllk9YnZFZlIWI.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Apple Watch Ultra 3新爱马仕表带</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqNHoVEvxUCkvO1oByRXFi7GFx4o.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Iphone 17 全线升级120HZ Promotion屏幕，和Pro &amp; Promax 齐平：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgv3YSn9Gw_VqFu_ZrTvUb3dzaCA.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Iphone 17 Pro &amp; Pro Max，因为散热用回铝制机身，以及均热板，增加续航</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgAmXEiaBGNi7VM6v93uRVscuBfO.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Iphone Air: 今几年来除了Apple Vision最接近 "One More Thing" 的产品</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlN_Vzp0qfojilvuFT-AVf0Xb7s2.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
