  <item>
    <title>第二十三期：分享一月所见所闻2024全明星，国足，和火爆的影视作品🎬</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65b9b4e4dde969cfdc23df9a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65b9b4e4dde969cfdc23df9a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 31 Jan 2024 02:48:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天浓缩了2024年一月份的点点滴滴：在NBA全明星首发披露震撼独家吐露，还有阿姆和我对体育行业。还有最近火爆的一些城中</span></p><span></span><p><span>趣事和爆🔥的影视作品分享给大家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="136">00:02:16</a> 东西方文化碰撞：中国球迷对全明星赛的期待与美国球员的占据</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="274">00:04:34</a> 利拉德的全明星之路：挑战东部后卫的位置争议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="617">00:10:17</a> 全明星首发揭晓：字母哥、恩比德和塔图姆领衔东部夺冠争夺战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="933">00:15:33</a> NBA东部的实力分析：米切尔和BROWNSON领衔，谁能夺得总冠军？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1249">00:20:49</a> 球队选择与情怀：回顾过去，展望未来！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1561">00:26:01</a> 中国足球：培养、发展与期望的挑战与机遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1873">00:31:13</a> Stanly Cup🍺的火爆现象：从体育到潮流生活方式的变迁！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2158">00:35:58</a>《Taylor Swift: The Eras Tour》:泰勒斯威夫特音乐与舞台的完美融合，一场震撼心灵的演出,不是Swifty的我也能看</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2499">00:41:39</a>《贝克汉姆》小贝的足球传奇与家庭爱情：一部让人动容的电影推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2810">00:46:50</a>《繁花》王家卫特点突出，味道浓厚上海文化终于正向了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3426">00:57:06</a>探寻篮球鞋市场的历史与未来：长青产品的需求与探索</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3747">01:02:27</a>大家新年快乐YES！告别烦！！</span></p><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><p><span>印第安纳波利斯机场为NBA全明星赛铺上了篮球场👀</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgqt0CsXA1Yoea0ufAtScLvR-i-A.jpg"></p><span></span><p><span>泰勒斯威夫特Era Tour 在洛杉矶公羊队主场Sofi Stadium， 每场上座人数高达7万</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjN-vbweZK367vkfU-hPQqo18ea6.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>警察发现一辆车里有价值$2,500的Stanly Cup保温杯</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs-LSnK5yr04nuTQrgx3dFGRSwj6.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>Nike Airmax Plus x ACW</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnjiNtU_XXgKLStaeCGfj8QwwK2D.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lv9m5oyymNMyc4n62FCeR0f8cHXw.m4a" length="91168572" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:02:51</itunes:duration>
